<item><title><![CDATA[Have you heard of Hypatia of Alexandria?]]></title><description><![CDATA[This guest post is for you if you've ever thought about the many great women in History!]]></description><link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-hypatia-of-alexandria</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-hypatia-of-alexandria</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Becario]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 05:07:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><em>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don&#8217;t need to understand every word; just keep reading.</em></p><p>En el cap&#237;tulo de hoy de comprensi&#243;n lectora, seguiremos hablando de las grandes figuras de la Antiguedad. Hoy, Hipatia de Alejandr&#237;a.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg" width="1456" height="1943" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1943,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:92231,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Hypatia by Odoardo Tabacchi, 1 January 1874,&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/214764014?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="Hypatia by Odoardo Tabacchi, 1 January 1874," title="Hypatia by Odoardo Tabacchi, 1 January 1874," srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!8ACl!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8a064c9f-6f9f-4881-992b-31773e9f4d71_1499x2000.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption"><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hypatia_by_Odoardo_Tabacchi_04.jpg">Hypatia by Odoardo Tabacchi, 1 January 1874,</a> Public Domain</figcaption></figure></div><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class="callout-block" data-callout="true"><p>Hipatia fue una de las &#250;ltimas grandes cient&#237;ficas de la antigua Alejandr&#237;a. Vivi&#243; entre los siglos IV y V y trabaj&#243; como matem&#225;tica, astr&#243;noma y fil&#243;sofa. Vivi&#243; en una &#233;poca en la que las tensiones religiosas y pol&#237;ticas estaban transformando profundamente la ciudad.</p><p></p><p>Hipatia representaba una tradici&#243;n intelectual basada en la investigaci&#243;n, la argumentaci&#243;n y el conocimiento acumulado durante siglos, y tuvo un final triste por ello. La situaci&#243;n pol&#237;tica y religiosa de Alejandr&#237;a se volvi&#243; cada vez m&#225;s complicada. Hipatia qued&#243; atrapada en esas luchas. Y en el a&#241;o 415 fue asesinada violentamente por una multitud.</p><p></p><p>Hoy en d&#237;a, su muerte es un s&#237;mbolo de c&#243;mo se destruy&#243; la cultura del mundo antiguo. La muerte de Hipatia no es solo la p&#233;rdida de una persona. Muestra lo que pasa cuando <span>el fanatismo y la lucha por el poder eliminan la educaci&#243;n y el pensamiento libre</span>.</p><p></p><p>La tragedia de Hipatia tambi&#233;n trajo una p&#233;rdida enorme: gran parte del conocimiento cient&#237;fico y filos&#243;fico del pasado se perdi&#243; para siempre.</p><p></p><p>Esta historia nos recuerda que el conocimiento puede desaparecer. <span>Una sociedad puede tardar siglos en construir la ciencia y perderla en muy poco tiempo.</span></p></div><h2>Cuestionario de autoevaluaci&#243;n:</h2><p>Veamos qu&#233; tal se te ha dado. No pasa nada si no has entendido todo a la primera. Intenta contestar todas las preguntas, y vuelve a repasar el texto si te falta alguna respuesta. &#161;Mucho &#225;nimo!</p><p>Suscr&#237;bete gratuitamente para ver el cuestionario. Y si te parece que el contenido lo vale, merece la pena, y te lo puedes permitir, tambi&#233;n puedes convertirte en suscriptor de pago para ayudar a que sigamos creando m&#225;s contenido como este.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>El cuestionario contiene preguntas de tipo test para evaluar tu comprensi&#243;n lectora.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-hypatia-of-alexandria?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary button-wrapper" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-hypatia-of-alexandria?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>Si te ha parecido interesante suscr&#237;bete, comparte, deja tus comentarios, o dale a &#8220;Like &#10084;&#65039;&#8221;. Eso nos ayuda a crecer y a seguir motivados, y te lo agradeceremos de coraz&#243;n.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-hypatia-of-alexandria/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/have-you-heard-of-hypatia-of-alexandria/comments"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p><strong>&#191;Y t&#250;? &#191;Conoc&#237;as la triste historia de Hipatia?</strong></p>]]></content:encoded></item>